                <pb facs="0689" n="585" sameAs="frus:frus1933v02/pg585"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">365.1121 Cimador, Guido/2: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Consul at Trieste
                        (Winslow)</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1933-08-03T18:00:00-04:00">August 3, 1933—6
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Guido Cimador, naturalized citizen, holder of passport No. 437712 dated September
                    3, 1931, is alleged to have been arrested at Prato Carnico, Udine, on June 3 and
                    to be still in prison.</p>
                <p>Please render appropriate assistance, telegraph brief report and send full report
                    by pouch.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Phillips</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
